Subject: Submit and complete actual GPU work at original GX finish markers
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4

Implement original PE completion underneath GXSetDrawDone/GXWaitDrawDone.
Seal and submit all prior GPU work, wait on Dawn after that submit, and retain
the same frame, attachments and rounded staging prefixes for continued draws.
Deliver actual latched PE callbacks on the GX owner with native SDK exclusion
and context restoration; worker/parser acknowledgement is not GPU completion.
Native clock queries service the owner latch for original time-only source waits.
Support valid startup GX state without inventing a recording frame.
Queue failure, device loss and genuine completion timeout remain failures.
The host supplies the shared OS interrupt/context provider; no game TU changes.

